te to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Doña Carmen to FCM Regalado, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\n*QUEZON AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Delta to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- BIR Rd. to Elliptical Rd., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Delta, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- FPJ Ave. to Araneta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*MARCOS HIGHWAY\nEASTBOUND:\n- F. Mariano, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Sta. Lucia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\n*ORTIGAS AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- EDSA to Meralco, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Lanuza, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nWESTBOUND\n- Greenmeadows to Meralco, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Greenhills to Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ROXAS BOULEVARD\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Raja Sulayaman to P. Ocampo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Coastal, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Kalaw to Padre Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*TAFT AVENUE\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- UN Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Buendia, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Arnaiz, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- UN Ave. to P. Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n#mmda",
